{
  "html": "<main><section class=\"page\"><div class=\"page-head\"><div><h1>导入配置</h1><p>收拢已有 MCP，先检查，再合并。</p></div></div><ol class=\"stepper\" aria-label=\"导入进度\"><li aria-current=\"step\"><span>1</span>选择来源</li><li><span>2</span>检查与合并</li><li><span>3</span>导入完成</li></ol><div class=\"editor-wrap\"><div class=\"source-choices\"><button class=\"source-choice\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">▤</span><span><strong>选择配置文件</strong><small>从本机读取 JSON 或 TOML</small></span></button><button class=\"source-choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">⌘</span><span><strong>粘贴配置</strong><small>直接粘贴已有 MCP 配置</small></span></button></div><label class=\"field\">配置来源<select><option>自动识别</option><option>OMP</option><option>Claude Code</option><option>Cursor</option><option>CodeBuddy</option><option>Codex</option><option>通用 MCP JSON</option></select></label><label class=\"file-drop\"><strong>选择要导入的配置文件</strong><span>文件在本机处理，预览不回显凭证。</span><input type=\"file\" accept=\".json,.toml,.jsonc\"></label><p class=\"note\">同名或同地址不代表相同连接；账号、参数、环境和工作目录都参与检查。</p><div class=\"actions form-actions\"><button class=\"control primary\" disabled=\"\">检查配置 →</button></div></div></section></main>",
